custom_second_button_text_color":"#ffffff","custom_second_button_bg_color":"#323232","custom_second_button_border_color":"#323232","custom_link_color":"#ffffff","show_background":false,"add_desktop_side_paddings":false,"add_mobile_side_paddings":false,"section_spacing_top":"none","section_spacing_bottom":"none","disable_lazy_loading":false}},"image_scroller_VVaiij":{"type":"image-scroller","blocks":{"slide_x9Nkpj":{"type":"slide","settings":{"media_type":"image","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/james_hagens_titan_ambassador.png","subheading":"","heading":"JAMES HAGENS","heading_size":"h3","body":"<p>At Titan BattleGear, we align with athletes who define the next era of hockey. <strong>James Hagens<\/strong> is one of them.<\/p><p>Now officially drafted by the <strong>Boston Bruins<\/strong>, Hagens has already transitioned from elite prospect to proven winner on the biggest stages in the sport. His selection by one of the NHL’s most storied franchises was the natural next step for a player who has consistently delivered under pressure, against top competition, and on the international stage.<\/p><p>Before turning pro, Hagens built one of the most dominant junior resumes in recent history. After developing through the <strong>USA Hockey National Team Development Program<\/strong>, he announced himself globally at the <strong>IIHF U18 World Championship<\/strong>, where he recorded 22 points in seven games. That performance shattered a long standing tournament scoring record and cemented his reputation as a generational offensive talent.<\/p><p>Hagens followed that up with a gold medal run at the World Juniors, centering the top line for <strong>Team USA<\/strong>. Competing against the best young players in the world, he played a central role in Team USA’s championship run, combining elite playmaking, pace, and composure in the highest pressure moments the tournament offers.<\/p><p>Those traits are exactly why James Hagens is Titan BattleGear’s premier athlete. His game is built on speed, deception, edge work, and relentless compete level. That demands equipment that does not compromise protection, comfort, or performance. Titan exists to meet that standard. When Hagens steps on the ice wearing Titan, it is a direct reflection of our mission to engineer the safest, most advanced protective apparel in hockey.<\/p><p>James Hagens represents the future of the game.<br\/><br\/>Titan BattleGear exists to protect it.<\/p><p>Together, we conquer.<\/p>","body_size":"body3","button_text":"","button_link":"","button_style":"primary"}}},"block_order":["slide_x9Nkpj"],"name":"t:sections.image_scroller.name","settings":{"scroller_type":"scroll_text","image_position":"left","desktop_img_ratio":1.4,"mobile_img_ratio":1,"content_alignment":"left","content_paddings_size":"xl","rotate_images":false,"container_size":"large","round_level":"default","color_scheme_variant":"own","color_scheme":"3","show_background":false,"add_desktop_side_paddings":true,"add_mobile_side_paddings":true,"section_spacing_top":"s","section_spacing_bottom":"s"}},"rich_text_qy3pgg":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_KfdeBh":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"PROTECTION ISN’T OPTIONAL. IT’S A STANDARD.","heading_size":"h3"}},"text_HiUK9b":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>At Titan BattleGear, we build the safest cut-resistant hockey baselayer and neck guards on the ice.<\/p><p>If you serve in uniform, respond to emergencies, teach the next generation, or support those who do, you understand what that means. Protection isn’t a feature. It’s a responsibility.<\/p><p>That’s why we proudly offer exclusive pricing through GovX for those who protect and lead in their communities.<\/p>","text_2":"","text_3":"","body_size":"body3"}},"buttons_kgjNi7":{"type":"buttons","disabled":true,"settings":{"btn_text":"Button label","btn_url":"","btn_style":"primary","extra_btn_text":"","extra_btn_url":"","extra_btn_style":"secondary"}}},"block_order":["heading_KfdeBh","text_HiUK9b","buttons_kgjNi7"],"disabled":true,"name":"t:sections.rich_text.name","settings":{"content_align":"left","container_size":"large","round_level":"default","color_scheme_variant":"default","color_scheme":"","show_background":false,"add_desktop_side_paddings":true,"add_mobile_side_paddings":true,"section_spacing_top":"l","section_spacing_bottom":"l"}},"hotspots_HqVKTQ":{"type":"hotspots","name":"t:sections.hotspots.name","settings":{"section_layout":"image-bottom","trigger_for_show_pin":"hover","subheading":"","heading":"TRAITS OF A TITAN","heading_size":"h3","body_richtext":"<p><strong>We’re not here to blend in. We’re here to lead. Titan BattleGear is for the relentless, the fearless, the game-changers. <\/strong><\/p><p><strong>Titan Ambassadors <\/strong>don’t just believe in protection - <strong> they stand behind it. <\/strong>Players, parents, and coaches who demand gear that keeps up with the game. Because performance isn’t optional - and protection is non-negotiable.<\/p>","body_size":"body3","content_alignment":"center","content_paddings_size":"xl","desktop_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/AXTON_AMBASSADOR_PAGE.png","enable_desktop_custom_img_ratio":true,"desktop_custom_image_ratio":0.4,"mobile_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/AXTON_AMBASSADOR_PAGE_MOBILE.png","enable_custom_mobile_img_ratio":false,"mobile_custom_image_ratio":0.6,"pin_inner_color":"#ffffff","pin_outer_color":"#d7fd52","container_size":"large","round_level":"default","color_scheme_variant":"own","color_scheme":"3","show_background":false,"add_desktop_side_paddings":true,"add_mobile_side_paddings":true,"section_spacing_top":"none","section_spacing_bottom":"s","disable_lazy_loading":false}},"image_scroller_thnVXk":{"type":"image-scroller","blocks":{"slide_b3nPHn":{"type":"slide","settings":{"media_type":"image","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/ambassadors_web_desktop.jpg","subheading":"","heading":"JOIN THE TITAN COMMUNITY","heading_size":"h3","body":"<p><strong>The Titan Community is more than an ambassador program - it’s a united force. An army of athletes, parents, coaches, and supporters standing together to change how protection is viewed in the game.<\/strong><\/p><p>We built Titan because too many players are still being asked to play faster, stronger, and more physical without protection that has kept pace. The Titan Community exists to challenge that status quo, raise awareness, shift expectations, and demand better for today’s athletes.<\/p><p><strong>This is where belief turns into action.<\/strong><\/p><p><strong>What community members do:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Help spread awareness about the importance of proper protection<\/li><li>Share Titan’s mission with teammates, families, and communities<\/li><li>Support a new standard for safety in the game<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>What community members receive:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Early access to product announcements and first looks<\/li><li>Invitations to challenges, giveaways, and brand missions<\/li><li>Seasonal perks and special offers<\/li><li>Exclusive Titan discounts to share with family and friends<\/li><li>Opportunities to be featured on Titan social media channels<\/li><li>Opportunities to be considered for the future Front Line, our invite only elite program invitations<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Who can join:<br\/><\/strong>All ages can apply.  We look for athletes, creators, parents, and coaches who are active on social, engaged with their community, and genuinely aligned with Titan’s mission.<\/p>","body_size":"body3","button_text":"","button_link":"","button_style":"primary"}}},"block_order":["slide_b3nPHn"],"name":"t:sections.image_scroller.name","settings":{"scroller_type":"scroll_text","image_position":"right","desktop_img_ratio":1.4,"mobile_img_ratio":1,"content_alignment":"left","content_paddings_size":"xl","rotate_images":false,"container_size":"large","round_level":"default","color_scheme_variant":"own","color_scheme":"3","show_background":false,"add_desktop_side_paddings":true,"a